              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Chef4Six"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good! I made this as one large strawberry tart - and used \"pecan Nut Crust\" from this site. I added some lemon juice and a nit of ginger to the strawberry sauce which gave the sauce wonderful flavoring! I placed the strawberry sauce and then slice strawberries on top of the crust right before serving to prevent the crust from getting soggy."
          },
