            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Chris Solomon"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I uses pineapple juice instead of apple juice for the glaze and cut the recipe in half and it was perfect for 12 tarts. I’m on my way to a garden club meeting so I shaped the strawberries sort of like flowers and made the tart cups out of pie dough—delicious?!",
            "datePublished": "2021-03-10T12:57:25.123Z"
          },
          {
