            },
            "reviewBody": "I substituted cran-raspberry juice for apple juice and added a smidge of almond extract. I also added blueberries to the strawberries since that's a family favorite ! It turned out delicious,!",
            "datePublished": "2026-07-02T17:49:40.181Z"
