              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Christine"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The orange juice was a great flavor addition to the strawberries. This was so easy to make and looked great. I'll be trying this with other fruits!",
            "datePublished": "2025-05-10T22:09:38.828Z"
          },
          {
