            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "eveeken"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a simple, yet fantastic, dessert to make. I didn't have apple juice so used mango juice in place and it turned out very yummy.",
            "datePublished": "2010-10-04T13:38:19.900Z"
          },
          {
