            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Forbidden Fruit Cocktail"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The apple glaze was a little weird tasting, but otherwise than that this was an easy way to satisfy my sweet tooth. I used frozen strawberries, which I heated in a saucepan for about 10 minutes on medium; took them out an sliced them, added corn starch to the liquid left in the pan, then added the strawberries again to let thicken. Yum.",
